  "ruleText": "Rev 203.04 Motion Hearings. Unless an oral motion hearing is ordered by the presiding officer, all motions shall be decided upon the writings submitted.\n\nSource. #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06\n\nNew. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
